# These CPU-only dispatcher and loader tests import Torch but make no CUDA or
# production-qualification claim. They remain fail-closed and manual until the
# repository has an approved, license-reviewed hermetic Torch >=2.10 intake
# compatible with the 2.10 stable ABI contract. The pinned Nix authority
# currently resolves Torch 2.12.0 and is not that intake.
